      "description": "Original MIT synthetic bead images, native EPS-SVR fit, ONNX exports and projects by OpenCVDataflowGUI contributors. Seven training widths and separate held-out widths/noise seeds. Width labels use an assumed 0.1 mm/pixel; this is not camera calibration or production bead measurement. Global brightness estimates coverage only under the trained lighting/background conditions. The dim control deliberately violates that condition. Continuous measurements are not confidence scores. See README.md, SOURCES.md, truth.json and benchmark.json.",
